Per-layer MSE & 18.52$\pm$1.68 & 229.26$^\S$ & +217.47 \\ % exp_id: mse30_uniform_s42, mse50_uniform_s42
Per-layer KL ($K{=}1$) & 9.05$\pm$0.02 & 34.85 & +23.06 \\ % exp_id: perlayer_kl_30_3seed, perlayer_kl_50_s42
